Cell[TextData[{
 "This document serves as a practical  introduction to defining neural \
circuits within the ",
 StyleBox["Creating Intelligence",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " framework. Circuits are compiled into stateful machines that process \
hyperdimensional sparse distributed representations (SDRs) and sparse \
holographic representations (SHRs)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"87579e7b-f6a0-41f8-82c2-9eb95fc7b7df"],

Cell["\<\
A JSON dataflow description language  fully specifies circuits composed of \
standardized building blocks:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ff9293d6-529a-4cc5-b93f-c817ac552344"],

