Cell["\<\
The \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]binning\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] decoder maps \
similar representations to bins, enumerated by integers 1,2,...
Similarity is defined via the pattern matching threshold implied by the data\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s hyperparameters.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"52e94159-dffd-4d97-973e-d7d2252cf6f0"],

